-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ב/8 (28.8.2022), תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר
-- לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ב.
-- The one-off grant to upper-division teaching employees of the schools the
-- Ministry ranked highest for achievements in תשפ"ב: who, how much by the
-- school's rank, pro-rating, when it is paid, and how it is treated for
-- other pay and for pension.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשפ"ב/8 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ב`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 The letterhead, the date and the reference number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The circular's number, the addressees, the greeting and the subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 The background: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 with the Secondary School Teachers' Association, approved by the Treasury's wage supervisor, and what it covers; no rule of its own.

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"ב
-- (common.l4: September 2021 is 1, August 2022 is 12, so September 2022 is 13).

§§ `1 תחולה`

@desc A teaching employee as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `achievement grant employee` HAS
    `rated on the teaching-employee scale`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of supervised secondary education` IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of secondary education the Ministry of Education supervises
    `employed in the upper division in תשפ"ב`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `position fraction in the upper division`                IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held in the upper division in תשפ"ב (1 = one full position)
    `share of the school year employed at the school`        IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of the school year תשפ"ב employed at the outstanding school, maternity leave counted as employment (section 2ג)
    `on sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `rank of the school`                                     IS A NUMBER  @desc the school's achievement rank 1 to 4 on the Ministry's list of winning schools, 0 if it is not on it

-- Preamble ¶15 and §1: the circular applies to teaching-scale employees of
-- the upper division employed by owners of supervised secondary education,
-- in proportion to their employment there, in or out of Oz LaTmura (§36 of
-- the agreement).
@ref akn:preamble/p15 akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN e IS AN `achievement grant employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `rated on the teaching-employee scale`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of supervised secondary education`
    AND e's `employed in the upper division in תשפ"ב`

§§ `2 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- §2א: the programme runs since תשע"ג by the format of the pedagogical
-- administration's letter of 21.10.2012; the upper division is grades
-- ט'-י"ב/י"ד in a four-year school and י'-י"ב/י"ד in a three-year or
-- six-year school.
@desc The kinds of school §2א names.
DECLARE `school kind` IS ONE OF
    `a four-year school`
    `a three-year school`
    `a six-year school`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN k IS A `school kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the lowest grade of the upper division` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `a four-year school` THEN 9
    OTHERWISE 10

-- Grade numbers: ט' is 9 ... י"ד is 14.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN k IS A `school kind`, `grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grade is in the upper division` k `grade` IF
        `grade` AT LEAST `the lowest grade of the upper division` k
    AND `grade` AT MOST 14

@desc One printed row of section 2ב: the school's rank and the grant for a full position, as updated to May 2022.
DECLARE `rank row` HAS
    `rank`                      IS A NUMBER
    `share of schools`          IS A STRING
    `grant for a full position` IS A NUMBER

-- §2ב: the teachers of the schools the Ministry found highest are entitled
-- to a one-off grant by the school's rank. ¶12: the amounts are updated by
-- the CPI of May 2022 against May 2021.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p1 akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9 akn:art_2__para_b/p10 akn:art_2__para_b/p11 akn:art_2__para_b/p12
`the grants by the school's rank` MEANS
    LIST `rank row` 1 "the top 10%"            8793.25,
         `rank row` 2 "the next 10%"           6594.94,
         `rank row` 3 "the next 10%"           4396.63,
         `rank row` 4 "the next 10%"           3297.46

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position grant for rank` r IS
    sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `grant for a full position`)
             (filter (GIVEN x YIELD x's `rank` EQUALS r) `the grants by the school's rank`))

-- §2ג: part-time or part-year: the proportional part, by the position in
-- the upper division and by the share of the year employed at the school
-- ("ו/או": both apply where both are partial). Maternity leave under the
-- Women's Employment Law counts as employment; unpaid leave after it does
-- not (both are in the input's share of the year). ¶2: a whole year on
-- sabbatical or unpaid leave earns nothing. §2ד: no position above 100%.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_c/p2 akn:art_2__para_d
GIVEN e IS AN `achievement grant employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the proportional share` e IS
    IF e's `on sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`
    THEN 0
    ELSE min (e's `position fraction in the upper division`) 1
             TIMES e's `share of the school year employed at the school`

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS
    ROUND (x TIMES 100) DIVIDED BY 100

@export The one-off grant for school achievements in the school year תשפ"ב owed to an upper-division teaching employee under circular תשפ"ב/8
GIVEN e IS AN `achievement grant employee` @desc the employee
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the achievement grant` e IS
    IF `the circular applies to` e
    THEN `to the agora` (`the full-position grant for rank` (e's `rank of the school`) TIMES `the proportional share` e)
    ELSE 0

-- §2ו: the grants are not part of the base for the hourly value, severance
-- pay or percentage supplements, and no study-fund contributions are made.
@desc The bases §2ו names.
DECLARE `pay base` IS ONE OF
    `the base of the hourly value`
    `the base of severance pay`
    `the base of percentage supplements`
    `the base of study-fund contributions`
    `the base of pension-fund contributions`

@ref akn:art_2__para_f akn:art_2__para_g
GIVEN b IS A `pay base`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant enters` b IF
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `the base of pension-fund contributions` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- §2ז: contributions to a pension provident fund: 5% from the employer and
-- 5% deducted from the teacher's pay.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g
`the employer's pension contribution rate` MEANS 0.05
`the employee's pension deduction rate`    MEANS 0.05

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` g IS
    `to the agora` (g TIMES `the employer's pension contribution rate`)

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pension deduction from the grant` g IS
    `to the agora` (g TIMES `the employee's pension deduction rate`)

DECLARE `grant action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER, `employer contribution paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner in payment-system topic 583`

-- §2ה: paid with August 2022's salary and no later than September 2022's.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e akn:art_2__para_g
GIVEN e IS AN `achievement grant employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `paying the achievement grant` e IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the achievement grant` paid contribution
          PROVIDED paid AT LEAST `the achievement grant` e
               AND contribution AT LEAST `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` (`the achievement grant` e)
    WITHIN `month number` August PLUS 1
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/8 §2ה: the grants are paid with August 2022's salary and no later than September 2022's"

§§ `3-4 The list of schools and the reimbursement`

-- §3: the programme and the list of winning schools are on the Ministry's
-- site; the school's rank is an input of this file (`rank of the school`).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN e IS AN `achievement grant employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school is on the list of winners` e IF
    e's `rank of the school` AT LEAST 1 AND e's `rank of the school` AT MOST 4

-- §4: reimbursement through payment-system topic 583, in August 2022's
-- payments transferred to the owners at the start of September 2022.
@ref akn:art_4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `grant action`
DECIDE `reimbursing the owners` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner in payment-system topic 583`
    WITHIN `month number` August PLUS 1
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/8 §4: the reimbursement is in August 2022's payments, transferred at the start of September 2022"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: the telephone numbers for questions, the signatures; no rule.

-- Examples.
`a full-time teacher at a rank-1 school` MEANS
    `achievement grant employee` WITH
        `rated on the teaching-employee scale`                   IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of supervised secondary education` IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division in תשפ"ב`                IS TRUE
        `position fraction in the upper division`                IS 1
        `share of the school year employed at the school`        IS 1
        `on sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`                 IS FALSE
        `rank of the school`                                     IS 1

`a half-time teacher for half the year at a rank-3 school` MEANS
    `achievement grant employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE 0.5 0.5 FALSE 3

`a teacher at 120% at a rank-2 school` MEANS
    `achievement grant employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE 1.2 1 FALSE 2

`a teacher on sabbatical all year` MEANS
    `achievement grant employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE 1 1 TRUE 1

`a teacher at a school not on the list` MEANS
    `achievement grant employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE 1 1 FALSE 0

#ASSERT `the achievement grant` `a full-time teacher at a rank-1 school` EQUALS 8793.25
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` `a half-time teacher for half the year at a rank-3 school` EQUALS 1099.16
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` `a teacher at 120% at a rank-2 school` EQUALS 6594.94
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` `a teacher on sabbatical all year` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` `a teacher at a school not on the list` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` 8793.25 EQUALS 439.66
#ASSERT `the grant enters` `the base of pension-fund contributions`
#ASSERT NOT `the grant enters` `the base of severance pay`
#ASSERT `the grade is in the upper division` `a four-year school` 9
#ASSERT NOT `the grade is in the upper division` `a six-year school` 9

#TRACE `paying the achievement grant` `a full-time teacher at a rank-1 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 8793.25 439.66 AT 12
